    {
      "question": "What is the Operations Console and where do I find it?",
      "answer": "The Operations Console is the platform owner's live view of everything happening across RackTrack. Open it at /dashboard, or click \"Console\" in the left sidebar (the link only appears for the platform owner). The sidebar shows on a desktop or laptop browser and on an iPad in either portrait or landscape; on a phone there is no sidebar, so go to /dashboard directly. If you have an old /logs bookmark, it now redirects here \u2014 logs became a tab inside this console.\n\nIt has two tabs:\n\u2022 Operations \u2014 \"Everything happening across RackTrack \u2014 who's scanning, what's working, what's failing.\" You get headline tiles (Scans today, Active users today, Total scans, Success rate, Accuracy (feedback), Users, Organizations, Failures (all)), a Live activity feed, Recent errors, Top scanners, Scans by organization, What users are doing, Authentication, All users and All organizations.\n\u2022 Logs \u2014 \"Live application log \u2014 email delivery, errors, and requests as the server records them.\"\n\nAt the top right are two controls: a Live / Paused button (auto-refresh on or off, refreshing every 5 seconds while Live) and a Refresh button for an immediate reload.",
      "symptoms": [
        "Where is the Operations Console",
        "What does /dashboard show",
        "Can't find the Console link",
        "What is the Logs tab"
      ],
      "rootCause": "DashboardPage renders a title 'Operations Console' with two tabs (ops, logs) and shared Live/Refresh controls; DesktopShell adds the '/dashboard' sidebar link only when user.role === 'owner'.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "client/src/pages/DashboardPage.jsx",
          "lines": "319-322",
          "snippet": "const TABS = [\n  { key: 'ops',  label: 'Operations', sub: \"Everything happening across RackTrack \u2014 who's scanning, what's working, what's failing.\" },\n  { key: 'logs', label: 'Logs',       sub: 'Live application log \u2014 email delivery, errors, and requests as the server records them.' },\n];"
        },
        {
          "file": "client/src/pages/DashboardPage.jsx",
          "lines": "335-351",
          "snippet": "<h1 className={styles.title}>Operations Console</h1>\n...\n{live ? 'Live' : 'Paused'}\n</button>\n<button className={styles.refreshBtn} onClick={() => setRefreshTick(n => n + 1)}>Refresh</button>"
        },
        {
          "file": "client/src/components/DesktopShell.jsx",
          "lines": "204-207",
          "snippet": "// Operations Console (live ops + server logs) \u2014 owner-only.\n...(isOwner ? [{ to: '/dashboard', label: 'Console', icon: <DashboardIcon />, end: false }] : []),"
        }
      ],
      "userCanSelfFix": true,
