    {
      "question": "My bookmark for /logs stopped working \u2014 it jumps to the dashboard.",
      "answer": "That is intentional. The logs are no longer a separate page; they are the \"Logs\" tab inside the Operations Console. The old /logs address now redirects to /dashboard, and you land on the Operations tab \u2014 click \"Logs\" to get the log viewer. Update your bookmark to /dashboard.",
      "symptoms": [
