      "answer": "The Lab page refreshes its switch list every 15 seconds. If one of those refreshes fails, the page keeps the list it already had and shows \"Device list stale \u2014 <reason>\" rather than emptying the page on a momentary blip.\n\nThe status badges and the \"Last polled\" age you're looking at may therefore be a little out of date. It usually clears on the next refresh; if it persists, the server or your connection to it is the problem.\n\nNote that the relative-time labels \u2014 \"audit N ago\" on each switch card, and \"Last polled\" in the panel for the selected device \u2014 re-age on screen every 10 seconds without re-fetching anything, so an ageing timestamp on its own does not mean something is wrong.",
