    {
      "question": "I'm stuck on \"Waiting for approval\" \u2014 how long does it take and what do I do?",
      "answer": "That screen means your organization was created but the RackTrack platform owner has not approved it yet. Until they do, you cannot scan or use any other part of the app \u2014 the block is enforced on the server, not just in the app, so there is no way around it.\n\nThe page rechecks by itself every 12 seconds, and you can tap \"Check now\" to force an immediate check. The moment your organization is approved you are taken straight into the app \u2014 you do not need to sign in again.\n\nThere is no fixed approval time; it depends entirely on when the platform owner acts. RackTrack does not email them when you sign up, so if you have been waiting, contact the platform owner directly and ask them to approve your organization. There is nothing you can change on your side to speed it up.\n\n(If the screen instead says \"Request not approved\" or \"Organization deactivated\", the situation is different \u2014 your organization was rejected or switched off, and you need to contact the platform owner about that specifically.)",
