      "question": "Why can't I see the scans my colleagues did? My Recent Scans list only has mine.",
      "answer": "That is how RackTrack is designed. What you see depends on your role:\n\n\u2022 Member or site manager \u2014 you see only the scans you personally ran, and only within your own Site.\n\u2022 Organization admin \u2014 sees every scan from every Site in the organization, whoever ran it.\n\u2022 RackTrack platform owner \u2014 sees everything on the platform.\n\nSo two technicians on the same Site each see their own history. If you need a colleague's scan, ask them to share the result (Share / report link on the results screen), or ask your organization admin, who can see all of them in the Organizations console.",
