        "Only one entry in Recent Scans after scanning twice",
        "Same rack ID (RK-\u2026) as before",
        "Results look identical, including old device names"
      ],
      "rootCause": "computeRackId hashes the uploaded file bytes (sha256, first 8 hex chars) to form RK-XXXXXXXX. If outputs/<rackId>/device_unit_map.json exists, /api/analyze short-circuits to the cached result, re-applies active-learning corrections and refreshes meta.timestamp (preserving first_scanned_at). No second folder is created.",
