        "HTTP 429"
      ],
      "rootCause": "app.js mounts authLimit (token bucket, rate 10/min, burst 20, keyed by the lowercased username/email in the request body) in front of /api/auth/login, /signup, /forgot-password, /reset-password and /login-with-code. The 429 body is {error:'rate_limited', message:'Too many uploads \u2014 retry in Ns'}; AuthContext.callApi throws data.error, so the raw token 'rate_limited' is what the login form renders.",
