        "Redirected to the home screen when tapping Integrations or Marketplace",
        "Dashboard or Lab page shows a refusal message",
        "HTTP 403 on /api/dashboard/owner or /api/lab/*"
      ],
      "rootCause": "requireRole(...) runs requireAuth then 403s with 'Insufficient permissions' when req.user.role isn't in the allow-list; on the client, AdminRoute redirects any role other than org_admin/owner to '/' rather than to /login.",
