      "question": "I left the report open, and now Download PDF does nothing / shows an error",
      "answer": "The pass that authorises the report expires after **5 minutes**. If you open the report, get distracted, and come back later, the **Download PDF** button inside the report fails \u2014 it reuses the same pass, which has by then expired, so the PDF opens to an authorisation error instead of your report.\n\nThe fix takes two taps: close the report (the **X** in the top-right of the report panel), tap **View** again \u2014 this mints a brand-new pass \u2014 then tap **Download PDF** straight away.\n\nSame advice if the PDF tab has been sitting open in the background for a while: go back to the scan results and reopen the report fresh rather than reusing the old tab.",
