      "answer": "On the scan result, find the report row (View, Share, Change Device, New Scan) and tap **Share**. Choose **Teams**, **Outlook** or **Slack**. A dialog titled \"Send report via <channel>\" opens:\n\n- **Recipient email** (required) \u2014 RackTrack remembers the last address you used for each channel on that device and pre-fills it next time.\n- A free-text box marked *(optional)*, labelled **Subject** for Outlook and **Message** for Teams and Slack. Leave it blank and RackTrack uses \"Rack scan report for <rack ID>\".\n\nTap **Send report**. The Share button changes to **Sending to <channel>**, then **Sent**, and a green bar at the bottom reads \"Sent to <address> via <channel>\". RackTrack renders a fresh PDF of the report and attaches it \u2014 the recipient gets the PDF, not a link.\n\nIf you leave the address blank you get **\"Recipient email is required.\"**; if it is malformed you get **\"Enter a valid email address.\"**",
