      "answer": "No \u2014 every report in RackTrack is generated **on demand**, at the moment you ask for it. There is no scheduling, no nightly batch, and no email digest.\n\nWhat happens automatically is different: after a scan (and after certain updates to it) RackTrack refreshes an internal `scan_result.json` snapshot of that rack, so the data is ready when you next tap **View**. That snapshot is not delivered anywhere; nothing is sent to you.\n\nIf you want a report on a cadence, you have to open the scan and share it each time.",
