      "question": "How do I change my profile picture, and how do I sign out?",
      "answer": "Both are on the PROFILE tab.\n\nProfile picture: tap your avatar at the top of the page (it has a small blue pencil badge on it). A sheet slides up titled \"Choose your picture\" with the available images. Tap the one you want \u2014 it saves straight away and the sheet closes by itself. While it is saving the images dim and the bottom button reads \"Saving\u2026\". If you change your mind and want to leave your picture as it is, tap Close.\n\nSign out: tap the exit icon in the top-right corner of the Profile header. A box appears asking \"Sign out?\" with the note \"You'll need to sign in again to scan racks.\" Confirm with the Sign out button, or tap Cancel to stay signed in (tapping outside the box does nothing). After signing out you are taken back to the home screen.\n\nThe page also shows your username, email, your site name and the month you joined (for example \"Sprintpark \u00b7 Since Jul 2026\"), along with your recent scans.",
