      "question": "How do I add someone to my team?",
      "answer": "Admin only. Open the Organizations console (Profile > Organization Dashboard, or go to /organizations).\n\nAn Organization is your company, it contains Sites (your buildings), and each Site contains members. Find the Site row you want. It has two buttons.\n\nInvite (the normal route \u2014 nobody shares a password):\n1. Tap Invite.\n2. Enter their Email and choose a Role \u2014 Member or Site Manager.\n3. Tap Create invite link.\n4. The link appears with a Copy button. The screen tells you: \"Send this link to <email>. It works once and expires in 7 days.\"\n5. Send them the link yourself \u2014 RackTrack does not email it. If you do not send it, nothing reaches them.\n\n+ Add member (for a shared or contractor account, or someone with no reachable email):\n1. Tap + Add member.\n2. Fill in Username, Email, Password (at least 8 characters with upper case, lower case, a digit and a symbol) and a Role.\n3. Tap Add member, then hand them the details.\n\nTo add a new building, use + Add site. Clicking a person or a site filters the scans grid below to just their work \u2014 click again to clear it.",
