    {
      "question": "How do I sign up, sign in, or reset my password?",
      "answer": "Sign up (creates a new organization, and you become its administrator):\n1. On the welcome screen tap Get Started.\n2. Fill in Email, Username, Organization, Password and Confirm password. All five are required.\n3. Watch the meter under the password. It names the one thing still missing, e.g. \"Need a digit\". It needs all five: 8 characters, an uppercase, a lowercase, a digit and a special char. Continue turns on once the meter reads \"\u2713 Strong password\", the second box reads \"\u2713 matches\", and Email and Username are filled in.\n4. Tap Continue, type the six-digit code from your email into the boxes, and tap Verify. Resend gets you a new code.\n\nSign in:\n1. Tap Sign in on the welcome screen.\n2. Fill in Username or email and Password. Leave Organization empty \u2014 it is marked (optional), and usernames are unique across RackTrack, so a blank field finds your account. Only fill it in if your administrator has told you to; it accepts your organization's or your Site's name. RackTrack staff (owner accounts) must always leave it blank.\n3. Tap Sign in. If you type an organization RackTrack doesn't recognise, you get \"Invalid organization or credentials\" \u2014 clear the field and try again.\n\nForgotten password:\n1. On the sign-in screen tap Forgot password?, enter your Email, tap Send reset code.\n2. Enter the six-digit code (it expires in 1 minute) and tap Verify code. Resend is there if you need another.\n3. RackTrack then asks whether you want to change your password \u2014 you are signed in either way. Choose Yes, change password to set a new one (same five password rules as signup), or No, take me to the app to go straight in and leave your old password unchanged.",
      "symptoms": [
        "how do I sign up",
        "Get Started",
        "Need a digit",
        "Strong password",
        "Forgot password?",
        "Verify code",
